 "substitutedBy": null,
 "summary": "Relates to creating the \"empire state cricket task force\" to promote and grow the game of cricket in New York state.",
 "title": "Creates the empire state cricket task force",
 "vetoMessages": {
  "items": [
   {
    "billId": {
     "basePrintNo": "S3807",
     "basePrintNoStr": "S3807-2019",
     "printNo": "S3807",
     "session": 2019,
     "version": ""
    },
    "billPage": 0,
    "chapter": 0,
    "lineEnd": 0,
    "lineStart": 0,
    "memoText": "\n \n                         VETO MESSAGE - No. 161\n \nTO THE SENATE:\n \nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n \nSenate Bill Number 3807-B, entitled:\n \n    \"AN ACT to create the empire state cricket task force; and providing\n      for the repeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof\"\n \n    NOT APPROVED\n \n  This  bill  would  establish  the Empire State cricket task force. The\ntask force would be responsible for conducting a comprehensive study and\ncreating strategies to promote the game of cricket within the  state  of\nNew York.\n \n  While  I  understand  the  appetite  to try to bring new entertainment\nsources to New York, comprehensive studies such as these require signif-\nicant state expenditures. It  is  irresponsible  to  negotiate  a  state\nfiscal plan for the year, only to then pass legislation that would throw\nthat  plan  out  of balance. Projects such as these must be discussed in\nthe context of the budget. For these reasons, I am constrained  to  veto\nthis bill.\n \n  The bill is disapproved.                    (signed) ANDREW M. CUOMO\n \n                               __________\n",
    "signedDate": null,
    "signer": "ANDREW M. CUOMO",
    "vetoNumber": 161,
    "vetoType": "STANDARD",
    "year": 2019
   }
  ],
